Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.69,0:00:09.83,TitleGlow,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,460)\fad(500,400)\blur2.5}Glimpse of Us\N{\fs88\fsp6\b0}Joji (Slowed + Reverb)
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.42,0:00:28.67,LyricGlow,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,490)\fad(200,150)\blur2.0}She'd take the world off my shoulders\NIf it was ever hard to move
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.13,0:00:38.38,LyricGlow,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,490)\fad(200,150)\blur2.0}She'd turn the rain to a rainbow\NWhen I was living in the blue
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.08,0:00:48.32,LyricGlow,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,490)\fad(200,150)\blur2.0}Why then, if she's so perfect\NDo I still wish that it was you?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.79,0:00:57.57,LyricGlow,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,490)\fad(200,150)\blur2.0}Perfect don't mean that it's working\NSo what can I do? (Ooh)
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.92,0:01:06.82,LyricGlow,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,490)\fad(200,150)\blur2.0}When you're out of sight\NIn my mind
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.51,0:01:17.23,LyricGlow,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,490)\fad(200,150)\blur2.0}'Cause sometimes I look in her eyes\NAnd that's where I find a glimpse of us
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.57,0:01:26.94,LyricGlow,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,490)\fad(200,150)\blur2.0}And I try to fall for her touch\NBut I'm thinking of the way it was
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.28,0:01:36.18,LyricGlow,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,490)\fad(200,150)\blur2.0}Said, "I'm fine" and said, "I moved on"\NI'm only here passing time in her arms
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.65,0:01:46.94,LyricGlow,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,490)\fad(200,150)\blur2.0}Hoping I'll find\NA glimpse of us
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.75,0:01:56.99,LyricGlow,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,490)\fad(200,150)\blur2.0}Tell me he savors your glory\NDoes he laugh the way I did?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.46,0:02:06.94,LyricGlow,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,490)\fad(200,150)\blur2.0}Is this a part of your story?\NOne that I had never lived
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.40,0:02:16.65,LyricGlow,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,490)\fad(200,150)\blur2.0}Maybe one day, you'll feel lonely\NAnd in his eyes, you'll get a glimpse
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.99,0:02:25.66,LyricGlow,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,490)\fad(200,150)\blur2.0}Maybe you'll start slipping slowly\NAnd find me again
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.01,0:02:35.49,LyricGlow,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,490)\fad(200,150)\blur2.0}When you're out of sight\NIn my mind
